title: "Safe Pricing Framework (PPP)"
abstract: "Reference implementation of the PPP (Premium, Promotion, Penetration) safe-pricing method for launching new products: an even premium anchor from the quality leader, an odd promotional price 10% below the market leader, a safe price zone, and break-even analysis."
